 "name": "Tidewraith",
 "role": "Splinterborn boss · Ring 2 Coral Drift · flyer · Void Pull, Splinter Volley, Telegraph AoE",
 "hitbox_blocks": [4.0, 1.0, 3.5],
 "notes": [
  "Facing north (-Z). Origin at the ground under its centre; it hovers with its belly about 13 px (0.8 blocks) up. 1 grid square = 1 texture pixel = 1/16 block. Hitbox 4 x 1 x 3.5 blocks around the body and inner wings; wing tips, tail and tendrils reach past it.",
  "A manta ray that drifted up out of the drowned sea: blue-grey skin with pale spots, coral and prismarine plates on the back and wings, kelp tendrils trailing below, and the splinter set like a gem between its eyes.",
  "Bones (16): root > body > head > fin_l, fin_r, splinter; body > wing_l > wing_l_outer; body > wing_r > wing_r_outer; body > tail > tail_tip; body > tendril_1..4.",
  "Animations: spawn (rises up past the island edge), idle (slow wing undulation), fly, glide, attack (tail whip), hurt, death (spirals down and breaks apart), ability_void_pull (wings spread wide, pulls toward the edge), ability_splinter_volley (gem flashes, shards fan out), ability_telegraph_aoe (curls up, then a bubble burst)."
 ],
